098-jin033-wangji:line081","text":"既而周光斬錢鳳，吳儒斬沈充，並傳首京師。有司議曰：「王敦滔天作逆，有無君之心，宜依崔杼、王浚故事，剖棺戮屍，以彰元惡。」於是發瘞出屍，焚其衣冠，跽而刑之。敦、充首同日懸于南桁，觀者莫不稱慶。敦首既懸，莫敢收葬者。尚書令郗鑒言於帝曰：「昔王莽漆頭以輗車，董卓然腹以照市，王淩儭土，徐馥焚首。前朝誅楊駿等，皆先極官刑，後聽私殯。然《春秋》許齊襄之葬紀侯，魏武義王修之哭袁譚。由斯言之，王誅加於上，私義行於下。臣以為可聽私葬，於義為弘。」昭許之，於是敦家收葬焉。含父子乘單船奔荊州刺史王舒，舒使人沈之于江，餘黨悉平。","annotation_status":"reviewed","text_layer":"received_chapter","mentions":[{"id":"c-jinshu-098-jin033-wangji:line081:m0002","start":2,"end":4,"surface":"周光","kind":"person","person_id":"fqd_otm_jc2","status":"contextual_provisional","interpretation_note":"以來源原字標記。"},{"id":"c-jinshu-098-jin033-wangji:line081:m0005","start":5,"end":7,"surface":"錢鳳","kind":"person","person_id":"762_5c8_663","status":"contextual_provisional","interpretation_note":"以來源原字標記。"},{"id":"c-jinshu-098-jin033-wangji:line081:m0008","start":8,"end":10,"surface":"吳儒","kind":"person","person_id":"fxt_25c_3fh","status":"contextual_provisional","interpretation_note":"以來源原字標記。"},{"id":"c-jinshu-098-jin033-wangji:line081:m0011","start":11,"end":13,"surface":"沈充","kind":"person","person_id":"4c2_19b_bf4","status":"contextual_provisional","interpretation_note":"以來源原字標記。"},{"id":"c-jinshu-098-jin033-wangji:line081:m0026","start":26,"end":28,"surface":"王敦","kind":"person","person_id":"39o_b6y_n74","status":"contextual_provisional","interpretation_note":"以來源原字標記。"},{"id":"c-jinshu-098-jin033-wangji:line081:m0041","start":41,"end":43,"surface":"崔杼","kind":"person","person_id":"xgd_r31_cmr","status":"contextual_provisional","interpretation_note":"以來源原字標記。"},{"id":"c-jinshu-098-jin033-wangji:line081:m0044","start":44,"end":46,"surface":"王浚","kind":"person","person_id":"468_0bf_170","status":"contextual_provisional","interpretation_note":"固定數位見證原形。殿本、平行史料確認所指；本處異體或誤字不作人物通用別名。"},{"id":"c-jinshu-098-jin033-wangji:line081:m0077","start":77,"end":78,"surface":"敦","kind":"person","person_id":"39o_b6y_n74","status":"contextual_provisional","interpretation_note":"以來源原字標記。"},{"id":"c-jinshu-098-jin033-wangji:line081:m0095","start":9