叔治","kind":"person","person_id":"u3f_18y_2gb","status":"contextual_provisional","interpretation_note":"以來源原字標記。"}],"text_layer":"received_chapter","source_quote":{"witness":"sg11","quote":"王脩字叔治，北海營陵人也。","raw_start":7681,"raw_end":7694,"raw_line":58},"chapter_id":"c-sanguozhi-011-jin098-dun","book_id":"b-sanguozhi-011","work_id":"w-sanguozhi","source_id":"s-sanguozhi-011-jin098-dun"},{"id":"c-songshu-050-hufan:p003","text":"義旗起，玄戰敗將出奔，藩於南掖門捉玄馬控，曰：「今羽林射手猶有八百，皆是義故西人，一旦捨此，欲歸可復得乎？」玄直以馬鞭指天而已，於是奔散相失。追及玄於蕪湖，玄見藩，喜謂張須無曰：「卿州故為多士，今乃復見王叔治。」桑落之戰，藩艦被燒，全鎧入水潛行三十許步，方得登岸。義軍既迫，不復得西，乃還家。高祖素聞藩直言於殷氏，又為玄盡節，召為員外散騎侍郎，參鎮軍軍事。","text_layer":"received_chapter","annotation_status":"reviewed","source_position":{"first_line":16,"last_line":16,"raw_start":563,"raw_end":741,"raw_character_offsets":[563,564,565,566,567,568,569,570,571,572,573,574,575,576,577,578,579,580,581,582,583,584,585,586,587,588,589,590,591,592,593,594,595,596,597,598,599,600,601,602,603,604,605,606,607,608,609,610,611,612,613,614,615,616,617,618,619,620,621,622,623,624,625,626,627,628,629,630,631,632,633,634,635,636,637,638,639,640,641,642,643,644,645,646,647,648,649,650,651,652,653,654,655,656,657,658,659,660,661,662,663,664,665,666,667,668,669,670,671,672,673,674,675,676,677,678,679,680,681,682,683,684,685,686,687,688,689,690,691,692,693,694,695,696,697,698,699,700,701,702,703,704,705,706,707,708,709,710,711,712,713,714,715,716,717,718,719,720,721,722,723,724,725,726,727,728,729,730,731,732,733,734,735,736,737,738,739,740],"revision_id":2371899},"mentions":[{"id":"c-songshu-050-hufan:p003:m0004","start":4,"end":5,"surface":"玄","kind":"person","person_id":"u9s_w6j_8mc_AAF","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-songshu-050-hufan:p003:m0011","start":11,"end":12,"surface":"藩","kind":"person","person_id":"otw_1ui_wba","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-songshu-050-hufan:p003:m0017","start":17,"end":18,"surface":"玄","kind":"person","person_id":"u9s_w6j_8mc_AAF","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-songshu-050